    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "REA Stokes and Quirke are delighted to bring to the market No. 19 Park Road, Ivowen, Kilsheelan, the last remaining 2 bed end of terrace new build house located in this exclusive residential development of 9 houses in a quiet cul-de-sac looking out onto the green area and playground. Finished to an exceptional standard throughout, this A-rated property offers energy-efficient, modern living in a highly convenient location in the village of Kilsheelan with the River Suir Blueway on your doorstep and just 10 minutes from Clonmel town centre and all amenities. The house boasts a spacious and well-appointed layout comprising two generous bedrooms and two bathrooms. The property benefits from a high-quality contemporary finish, with stylish kitchen and fitted bathrooms. Heating is provided by an efficient air-to-water heat pump system, ensuring year-round comfort and excellent energy performance. The house is presented in pristine, turnkey condition and ready for immediate occupation. The property also qualifies for the First Time Buyer Help to Buy Scheme, offering an excellent opportunity for those starting out on the property ladder. Situated in a well-established and attractive residential area, enjoying excellent access to local schools, shops, and services. These new built homes have to be seen to be truly appreciated. Viewing is highly recommended and strictly by appointment through REA Stokes and Quirke. \n\nAccommodation\n\nHallway\n1.90m x 4.10m Bright and spacious\n\nDownstairs WC\n wc, whb, tiled floor\n\nKitchen/Dining/Living Area\n4.85m x 8.90m open plan kitchen/dining living area kitchen area measures 2.85m x 5.1m and has built in units at eye and floor level , facing green area to front\n\nLanding\n hotpress thereof\n\nBedroom 1\n3.50m x 4.85m overlooking rear garden\n\nBedroom 2\n3.80m x 3.19m overlooking green area and childrens playground\n\nBathroom\n2.00m x 2.47m Wc. whb, bath, tiled\n\n\nOutside\nOff street parking large private rear garden"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "A rated BER\nFirst time buyers grant available \nPristine new built condition.\nExcellent location. \n \n Air to water heating\nESB connected\nMains water\nMains sewage \n On your doorstep you can find the shop, post office, national primary school and GAA grounds"
      },
